{
    "title": "JusTalk Kids - Safe Messenger",
    "description": "JusTalk Kids is a FREE specially designed voice and video calling and instant messaging app for children. It aims to provide a safe communication platform for kids to stay in touch with family, friends, and schoolmates without exposure to inappropriate content or interference from strangers. All communications are encrypted to ensure privacy protection. In addition to communication features, the app offers various learning tools, such as fun educational videos, a drawing board, and a text editor, to encourage creative and scholarly interaction among children. We will continue to enhance JusTalk Kids' features, creating a safe and convenient communication platform for children while providing a more diverse experience.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n<b>Secure Calling and Chatting App Designed for Children\r\nJusTalk Kids strictly protects each child's personal information, ensuring their privacy is not violated or abused. It provides compelling parental management features, allowing busy parents or concerned guardians to actively manage their child's usage within JusTalk Kids and keep them informed about their child's behavior in the app.\r\n\r\n<b>Block Strangers\r\nBoth parties need to send a friend request to each other to become friends on the app. The parental password feature grants parents control over their child's usage, managing aspects like friend additions, viewing call records, and controlling chat time.\r\n\r\n<b>Sensitive Content Warning\r\nThe system immediately blocks and notifies parents when children send or receive sensitive images/videos. Parents can review and decide whether the content suits their child, promoting better understanding and handling of complex emotions and information.\r\n\r\n<b>JusTalk Parent Account\r\nThe Parent Account bridges the parent and child apps, facilitating accessible communication. It also empowers parents as digital guardians, allowing better management and control over their child's online activities.\r\n\r\n<b> High-Definition Voice and Video Calls\r\nHigh-quality audio and video calls offer exciting benefits for children, allowing clear communication and facetime with family and friends regardless of distance. Features like 1-on-1 and group calls, high-quality call recording, real-time interactive games, collaborative doodling during calls, and dynamic sharing of childhood moments enhance the overall communication experience.\r\n\r\n<b>Interactive Games</b>\r\nChildren can play built-in interactive games while engaging in facetime with friends or family. Many of these games require kids to solve various puzzles and challenges, fostering their problem-solving abilities and logical thinking, thus stimulating intellectual development. These games enrich children's lives and cultivate their creativity, intelligence, and social skills.\r\n\r\n<b>Feature-rich IM Chatting</b>\r\nChildren can use JusTalk Kids to connect with family, friends, and schoolmates, improving communication skills and writing abilities through text, images, videos, voice messages, emojis, stickers, and GIFs.\r\n\r\n<b> Share Childhood Moments</b>\r\nChildren can express their unique thoughts, ideas, and imagination by sharing creative content such as drawings, music, and texts. Posting moments allows them to record special moments, fostering creativity and sharing with family and friends.\r\n\r\n<b>Educational Videos on Kidstube</b>\r\nJusTalk developed Kidstube, a video platform with educational content ranging from science experiments to creative arts and crafts.\r\n\r\n<b> Comprehensive Safety and Privacy Protection</b>\r\nJusTalk Kids prioritizes the safety and privacy of children. All communications are end-to-end encrypted, preventing unauthorized access to children's information. \r\n\r\nTerms: https://kids.justalk.com/terms.html\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://kids.justalk.com/privacy.html\r\n---------------------------------\r\nWe're always excited to hear from you! Please feel free to contact us via email: kids@justalk.com</b></b></b></b></b>",
    "descriptionHTML": "JusTalk Kids is a FREE specially designed voice and video calling and instant messaging app for children. It aims to provide a safe communication platform for kids to stay in touch with family, friends, and schoolmates without exposure to inappropriate content or interference from strangers. All communications are encrypted to ensure privacy protection. In addition to communication features, the app offers various learning tools, such as fun educational videos, a drawing board, and a text editor, to encourage creative and scholarly interaction among children. We will continue to enhance JusTalk Kids&#39; features, creating a safe and convenient communication platform for children while providing a more diverse experience.<br><br>Key Features:<br><b>Secure Calling and Chatting App Designed for Children<br>JusTalk Kids strictly protects each child&#39;s personal information, ensuring their privacy is not violated or abused. It provides compelling parental management features, allowing busy parents or concerned guardians to actively manage their child&#39;s usage within JusTalk Kids and keep them informed about their child&#39;s behavior in the app.<br><br><b>Block Strangers<br>Both parties need to send a friend request to each other to become friends on the app. The parental password feature grants parents control over their child&#39;s usage, managing aspects like friend additions, viewing call records, and controlling chat time.<br><br><b>Sensitive Content Warning<br>The system immediately blocks and notifies parents when children send or receive sensitive images/videos. Parents can review and decide whether the content suits their child, promoting better understanding and handling of complex emotions and information.<br><br><b>JusTalk Parent Account<br>The Parent Account bridges the parent and child apps, facilitating accessible communication. It also empowers parents as digital guardians, allowing better management and control over their ch